OpenHome Sample Players (https://github.com/openhome/ohPlayer) for Mac
Windows, Linux and Raspberry Pi.

=========================================================================================
#Installation
 Applicable : 
##Pre requisite : 
         - aarch64 target running raspios (tested on trixie)
         - Modules package installed (apt) : build-essential, clang, libglib2.0-dev, libglib2.0-dev, libssl-dev
##Build : 
```bash
git clone https://github.com/jchassin/ohPlayer
cd ohPlayer ; ./fetch_deps.sh
cd linux ; make
```

##Rebuild with full openhome stack (ohNet...)
 See https://github.com/jchassin/ohContainerBuilder
 
 Deprecated : An ansible playbook is created for non Linn people (those who have no account in linn domain) : 
	#https://galaxy.ansible.com/jchassin/ohplayer

